[03:39] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'if you\'ve got it. One continuous take, no cuts. If you mess up, keep going or restart from scratch. Never stitch two clips together. Try to record somewhere quiet with soft, even lighting. Nothing harsh or shadowy and keep the background'

[03:53] [scene:talk]
